WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.612
Commissioner Lucki and the Nova Scotia mass shooting.

00:00:03.562 --> 00:00:12.650
Internal RCMP notes revealed Lucki pressured investigators to release firearms information to support the government's gun control legislation.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:19.525
22 people died in a 13-hour rampage while the RCMP failed to issue an emergency alert.

00:00:19.525 --> 00:00:24.375
The Mass Casualty Commission found catastrophic failures at every level.
